OL,3,GNEWSAAir ambulance 'on a knife edge'
OL,4,Aafter busy summer
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn air ambulance service has renewed
OL,7,Fcalls for help to buy a new helicopter
OL,8,Fafter attending more than 550 incidents
OL,9,Fduring the summer.
OL,11,FThe Great North Air Ambulance Service
OL,12,F(GNAAS) responded to 557 emergency
OL,13,Fcall-outs from 21 June to the third
OL,14,Fweek in September this year.
OL,16,FThe charity has secured funding for two
OL,17,Fnew aircraft and has appealed to the
OL,18,Fpublic to help raise funds for a third.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,400,390,260,160,0,100
