OL,3,GNEWSAAir ambulance 'on a knife edge'
OL,4,Aafter busy summer
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe charity's critical care teams,
OL,7,Fwhich are based in Eaglescliffe and
OL,8,FPenrith, responded to 331 call-outs in
OL,9,Fthe North East, 173 in Cumbria, 24 in
OL,10,FNorthumberland, 10 in the Isle of Man,
OL,11,Feight in Scotland, seven in Yorkshire,
OL,12,Fand four in Lancashire.
